  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Dragon Age: Inquisition GOTY Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/2291/450x258/dragon-age-inquisition-goty-edition-goty-edition-pc-game-ea-app-cover.jpg?v=1790942400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/2291-buy-dragon-age-inquisition-goty-edition-goty-edition-pc-game-ea-app/",
      "user": "gamer-307033",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "An absolutely mediocre game. The gameplay becomes tedious and repetitive over time, with numerous pointless side quests designed solely to pad out the playtime. A game based on exploration, where the exploration is probably the most tedious and least rewarding part of the entire game, given the useless treasures scattered across the various maps. Luckily, I bought it on sale for $10; I’m literally forcing myself to finish it so I can then erase it from my memory forever. 5/10"
    },
    {
      "game": "CONTROL Resonant",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/13170/450x258/control-resonant-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790942400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/13170-buy-control-resonant-pc-steam/",
      "user": "RadKit",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "It's not quite the lightning in the bottle that the first game was but it is VERY Good, much more open. Fun to explore and the combat is pretty good, the story and voice acting is excellent. Definitely worth the price and the experience."
    },
    {
      "game": "LEGO Batman 2: DC Super Heroes",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/1604/450x258/lego-batman-2-dc-super-heroes-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790942400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/1604-buy-lego-batman-2-dc-super-heroes-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "Sebster",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/7047560-1632818486.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "I miss this game. I absolutely adore it. I could play this for hours on end as a kid and make no progress whatsoever. I finally went through a 100% completion of the game last year, and it was a nostalgia trip. It was still fun and i can especially still see, why no other game can engage a kid with a young imagination as my own younger self. This game gives you an entire comic-book accurate version of Gotham City, parted up in the three islands as we know from the lore. From a comic-book game standpoint this game excels, representing the Justice League as the teamwork group it's supposed to be, showing the characters' support for eachother in a way The Lego Batman Movie ignored, for the sake of comedy. The characters are modernized variations of LEGO characters we had seen prior, while not afraid to include those designs of the classic LEGO Batman Videogame that worked back then (such as Gordon rocking the classic male LEGO hairpiece) with additionally; an entire roster of interconnected characters from the DC universe. This however is a game that serves something for everyone, as kids will have interactable roller coasters and an entire amusement park to roam in, built into the open digital world. The side characters are collected through fun mini-bossfights also found in the open world, and going back into levels is always fun, with memorable LEGO-game gags in the traditional way.\n\n\n\nI love this game, and it will always keep a place in my heart. The story, dynamics and open world interactions are memories i hold onto even today."
    },
    {
      "game": "Crimson Desert Enhanced Deluxe Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/21082/450x258/crimson-desert-enhanced-deluxe-edition-pc-mac-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790942400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/21082-buy-crimson-desert-enhanced-deluxe-edition-pc-mac-steam/",
      "user": "Silverfang",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/6287100-1549204039.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Lots of things to do with huge exploration. \n\n\n\nDont like walking ? Glide around map. Geta horse . Horse feels slow ? Go to Delesya , steal dragon egg, hatch it , feed it, ride a dragon. HMMMMM not good enough, go back to Delesya , tame HUGE dragon . \n\n\n\nJust scratching the surface"
    }
